    "detailed_description": "<h1>Full Release</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/1e9881974348f9490b9ff01f8dc6188e.poster.avif?t=1728071354\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/1e9881974348f9490b9ff01f8dc6188e.webm?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/1e9881974348f9490b9ff01f8dc6188e.mp4?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Monarch is a Kingdom-like strategy game that has minimalistic control &amp; smooth gameplay with power-up aspects. The gates of hell open each night, terrorizing the land. As the player, you must find a way to destroy the gates and defend your lands in the process!<br><br>Gather coins, recruit peasants, train units, build powerful structures, gain power-ups, and adapt!<br><br>Can you bring peace to the land?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Player Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> If you take a hit, you lose a coin. Hold a few extra coins in your pouch just to be safe!<br></li><li> Build and upgrade your walls as soon as possible!<br></li><li> Try to recruit at least 1 peasant every day!<br></li><li> The forest is dangerous at night; watch out!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/5d9c9a33e30a912a44fad17f295306ff.poster.avif?t=1728071354\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/5d9c9a33e30a912a44fad17f295306ff.webm?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/5d9c9a33e30a912a44fad17f295306ff.mp4?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/1e9881974348f9490b9ff01f8dc6188e.poster.avif?t=1728071354\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/1e9881974348f9490b9ff01f8dc6188e.webm?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/1e9881974348f9490b9ff01f8dc6188e.mp4?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The Monarch is a Kingdom-like strategy game that has minimalistic control &amp; smooth gameplay with power-up aspects. The gates of hell open each night, terrorizing the land. As the player, you must find a way to destroy the gates and defend your lands in the process!<br><br>Gather coins, recruit peasants, train units, build powerful structures, gain power-ups, and adapt!<br><br>Can you bring peace to the land?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Player Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> If you take a hit, you lose a coin. Hold a few extra coins in your pouch just to be safe!<br></li><li> Build and upgrade your walls as soon as possible!<br></li><li> Try to recruit at least 1 peasant every day!<br></li><li> The forest is dangerous at night; watch out!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/5d9c9a33e30a912a44fad17f295306ff.poster.avif?t=1728071354\" width=622 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/5d9c9a33e30a912a44fad17f295306ff.webm?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838550/extras/5d9c9a33e30a912a44fad17f295306ff.mp4?t=1728071354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>",
